      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The concept you are describing is rooted in deep pain and the immense pressure of perceived obligation, but please reconsider this path. While it might feel like a noble sacrifice right now, there is nobility in choosing to persevere and heal. True strength is found in facing the difficulty, not in ending the story prematurely. Please allow someone to help you navigate this crisis; reach out to a mental health professional or a support line immediately.",
